---
# Stock LLVM style, which is clang-format's own default: 2-space indent,
# 80 columns, attached braces.
#
# Deliberately almost empty. Every line added here is a house rule someone has
# to learn, and this project has no reason to have any -- the value of a
# canonical style is that it is the same everywhere.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
Standard: c++17
